            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>An apparatus for diagnosing a battery according to an embodiment of the present disclosure includes a voltage measuring unit configured to measure voltages of a plurality of batteries; and a control unit configured to calculate a voltage deviation of the plurality of batteries, calculate a voltage deviation variation of each of the plurality of batteries at each predetermined period, and compare a pattern of the voltage deviation variation of each of the plurality of batteries with a preset diagnosis pattern to diagnose a state of each of the plurality of batteries.</p>
            </abstract>
